          "h": "Fixes",
          "b": "Reuse connections (a pool, or HTTP/2 to carry many requests on one). Open them before you need them: warm the pool at startup, before taking traffic. Use TLS 1.3. For servers sending large responses on rarely used connections, consider <code>tcp_slow_start_after_idle=0</code>."
